## Third-Party Components and Assets

### Complementary Unbound (Visual Reference Only)
- **Status**: Visual reference only
- **Usage**: No proprietary assets or code copied
- **Implementation**: Original shader code and implementation
- **Attribution**: Complementary Unbound is a visual reference only

### Iris Shader Loader
- **Status**: Compatible implementation
- **Usage**: Iris-specific shaderpack format
- **Attribution**: IrisShaders/Iris (https://github.com/IrisShaders/Iris)

### Sodium Renderer
- **Status**: Compatible implementation
- **Usage**: Sodium-specific rendering pipeline
- **Attribution**: Sodium development team

### Fabulously Optimized Modpack
- **Status**: Compatible implementation
- **Usage**: Fabulously Optimized 1.21.11 compatibility
- **Attribution**: Fabulously-Optimized/fabulously-optimized (https://github.com/Fabulously-Optimized/fabulously-optimized)

### Minecraft Java 1.21.11
- **Status**: Target platform
- **Usage**: Minecraft Java 1.21.11 compatibility
- **Attribution**: Mojang Studios

### NVIDIA GeForce 940MX
- **Status**: Target hardware
- **Usage**: NVIDIA GeForce 940MX optimization
- **Attribution**: NVIDIA Corporation

### ASUS X405UQ
- **Status**: Target device
- **Usage**: ASUS X405UQ optimization
- **Attribution**: ASUS Corporation

